Stake_Integration_Concrete_Test
├── given paused
│  └── it should revert
└── given not paused
   ├── when amount zero
   │  └── it should revert
   └── when amount not zero
      ├── given insufficient allowance
      │  └── it should revert
      ├── given insufficient balance
      │  └── it should revert
      └── given sufficient allowance and balance
         ├── given no stakes in the pool
         │  ├── given fresh pool
         │  │  └── it should credit the full amount without a fee
         │  │     ├── it should set the staker balance to the amount
         │  │     ├── it should not open a payout round
         │  │     ├── it should pull the tokens into the pool
         │  │     └── it should emit {Staked} event
         │  └── given pool emptied by earlier stakers
         │     └── it should credit the full amount without a fee or past dividends
         └── given stakes in the pool
            ├── given fee rounds down to zero
            │  └── it should credit the full amount without opening a payout round
            └── given fee not zero
               ├── given staker has no pending reward
               │  └── it should charge the fee and spread it over all stakes
               │     ├── it should credit the amount minus the fee
               │     ├── it should open a payout round with the fee
               │     ├── it should share the fee with the new staker too
               │     └── it should emit {Payout} and {Staked} events
               └── given staker has pending reward
                  └── it should pay the pending reward and charge the fee
                     ├── it should transfer the pending reward to the staker
                     ├── it should credit the amount minus the fee on top of the old stake
                     └── it should emit {Payout}, {ClaimReward} and {Staked} events
